        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mid terrace three bedroom house.\r\nSought after location in Wicklow town.\r\nConvenient  to M11 offering ease of access to Dublin city centre and further afield.\r\nExtending to approximately 73 sq. m (785 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a mid terraced three bedroom house with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers on street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 73 sq. m (785sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant possession."
